<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>开户 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%BC%80%E6%88%B7/</link><description>Recent content in 开户 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%BC%80%E6%88%B7/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>银行与邮局</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/bank-and-post/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/bank-and-post/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇拆成四个细化场景：银行开户、ATM 取现与柜台存取转账、去邮局寄包裹回中国、包裹投递失败去邮局问再加寄信买邮票。到美国之后，&lt;strong&gt;银行账户和邮局是两件必须尽快搞定的事&lt;/strong&gt;——发工资要 direct deposit，交房租要转账；往国内寄东西则要面对报关单和一整排看不懂的运费档位。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>